{
  "name": "Learnify \u2013 06 RAG Query / AI Tutor",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "d13e236c-fa47-4e33-97e9-3b2839b540bb",
      "name": "Pipeline Info",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        240,
        -20
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## \ud83e\udd16 RAG Query / AI Tutor Pipeline\n\n**Webhook:** `POST /webhook/learnify-rag-query`\n\n**Request body:**\n```json\n{ \"question\": \"Explain photosynthesis\",\n  \"subject\": \"Biology\", \"topic\": \"Photosynthesis\",\n  \"curriculumType\": \"WAEC\",\n  \"mode\": \"tutor\" }\n```\n\n**mode options:** `tutor` | `quiz` | `planner`\n\n**Flow:** Embeds question \u2192 vector search \u2192 injects top-5 chunks\n\u2192 Gemini generates grounded answer.\n\n**Env vars needed:**\n- `GOOGLE_PALM_API` credential\n- `backendUrl` in Set Config node",
        "height": 280,
        "width": 460,
        "color": 2
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "learnify-rag-query",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "551dda24-50f9-4442-a0bd-8334c1cb94a9",
      "name": "Webhook - RAG Query",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        260,
        300
      ],
      "webhookId": "learnify-rag-query"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "c445d0c7-0be9-4c08-9446-504bb3a4bf28",
              "name": "backendUrl",
              "value": "https://your-backend-url.com",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "59a7762e-3d09-4b81-b84b-322fd55a74c5",
      "name": "Set Config - RAG Query",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        510,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const body = $('Webhook - RAG Query').item.json.body || $('Webhook - RAG Query').item.json;\nif (!body.question) throw new Error('Missing required field: question');\nreturn [{ json: { ...body, curriculumType: body.curriculumType || 'WAEC', mode: body.mode || 'tutor' } }];"
      },
      "id": "fd04b474-b58c-42da-a53d-2026f1469646",
      "name": "Code - Validate RAG Query",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        760,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://generativelanguage.googleapis.com/v1beta/models/text-embedding-004:embedContent",
        "authentication": "predefinedCredentialType",
        "nodeCredentialType": "googlePalmApi",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ model: 'models/text-embedding-004', content: { parts: [{ text: $json.question }] } }) }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "ee87b2ad-f23c-4dd8-a8c4-a4ac615393a2",
      "name": "Gemini Credential - Embed RAG Query",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1010,
        300
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "googlePalmApi": {
          "id": "",
          "name": "Google Gemini API"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const query = $('Code - Validate RAG Query').item.json;\nconst embedding = $input.first().json.embedding?.values || [];\nif (!embedding.length) throw new Error('No query embedding returned from Gemini.');\nreturn [{ json: { ...query, embedding, limit: 5 } }];"
      },
      "id": "63412a63-6633-4821-bc6a-789aa4329e49",
      "name": "Code - Prepare RAG Search",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1260,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $('Set Config - RAG Query').item.json.backendUrl + '/api/rag/search' }}",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify($json) }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "bad38548-b4ad-4151-82c9-e9e56bfa2560",
      "name": "Backend - Search RAG Context",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1510,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const query = $('Code - Validate RAG Query').item.json;\nconst result = $input.first().json;\nconst chunks = result.data || result.matches || [];\nconst context = Array.isArray(chunks) ? chunks.map((item, index) => `SOURCE ${index + 1}:\\n${item.chunkText || item.text || item.content || ''}`).join('\\n\\n') : '';\nlet task = 'Answer like a patient AI tutor with simple explanation, example and one practice question.';\nif (query.mode === 'quiz') task = 'Generate quiz questions based only on the retrieved curriculum context.';\nif (query.mode === 'planner') task = 'Create a study plan based only on the retrieved curriculum context.';\nconst prompt = `\nYou are Learnify, a curriculum-aware educational AI.\n\nCurriculum: ${query.curriculumType}\nSubject: ${query.subject || ''}\nTopic: ${query.topic || ''}\nMode: ${query.mode}\n\nRetrieved Curriculum Context:\n${context || 'No curriculum context found.'}\n\nStudent Request:\n${query.question}\n\nTask:\n${task}\n\nRules:\n- Use retrieved context as primary source.\n- If context is insufficient, say what is missing.\n- Keep response student-friendly.\n`;\nreturn [{ json: { prompt, context } }];"
      },
      "id": "a281ed38-4d39-4e86-8ac6-2e364f2cd1e7",
      "name": "Code - Build RAG Prompt",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1760,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://generativelanguage.googleapis.com/v1beta/models/gemini-2.5-flash:generateContent",
        "authentication": "predefinedCredentialType",
        "nodeCredentialType": "googlePalmApi",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ contents: [{ parts: [{ text: $json.prompt }] }] }) }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "0d4e2088-24dd-424a-b2fe-f5e6b47770cf",
      "name": "Gemini Credential - RAG Answer",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        2010,
        300
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "googlePalmApi": {
          "id": "",
          "name": "Google Gemini API"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const answer = $input.first().json.candidates?.[0]?.content?.parts?.[0]?.text || 'No answer generated.';\nreturn [{ json: { success: true, answer } }];"
      },
      "id": "ce3671b6-bb61-4762-99dc-d5ba6c5b8947",
      "name": "Code - Format RAG Answer",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        2260,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={{ $json }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "0d3ce9e2-3e79-486f-b293-c8d74d740848",
      "name": "Respond - RAG Query Complete",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        2510,
        300
      ]
    }
  ],
